  provenance: "Copied 2026-10-25 from Assets/FDS Assets/Aircraft/F-18E.prefab's AerialArcade
    ControlSurface settings (transform names, axes, max angles, smoothing). Rudder
    travel AUTHORED at 30\xB0 (the FDS prefab used 50\xB0). Presentation only; the
    flight core never reads it. Game missiles (2026-10-29, W65): the shape is Air
    Wing's own GameMissile (a generic 3 m capsule and four fins, not any real missile's);
    the trail is General Quarters' GQ_FX_Trail_Threat; it lingers 3 s; a burst that
    does not kill plays the explosion at 0.8. AUTHORED by eye). Explosions (2026-10-29,
    SIX: 'collisions and kills should render explosions'): General Quarters' GQ_FX_Warhead
    (its HDRP particle shader; an 18 m flash, a fireball of 25 flames 4-6 m across,
    smoke 6-8 m for 5-8 s, debris). airExplosionScale 1.5 (a fireball about 20 m
    across against the 18 m jet), impactExplosionScale 2, explosionLifeS 9 (the smoke's
    life; General Quarters uses 9 s): AUTHORED from the effect's sizes. Replaced
    the same day Assets/_VFX's HD_Naval_Explosion, whose built-in-pipeline particle
    shader HDRP draws as squares."
